    {
      "id": "turn_772cd2eedc99",
      "space_id": "spc_68eb12f5be88",
      "role": "athena",
      "text": "### This week on the channel\n\nA handful of new songs came in from the creators you follow, and **two** of them fit the late-night sound you like.\n\n- *Low Tide Radio* by Moss Arcade is the strongest: slow, warm, no vocals.\n- *Paper Moons* is lovely but runs long for a video.\n\nIf you keep one, its credits line would read like this:\n\n```\nMusic: \"Low Tide Radio\" by Moss Arcade, used with permission\n```",
      "created": "2026-11-03T18:59:09Z",
      "cost_usd": 0.00783525,
      "parts": [
        {
